{"id":"remote-viewer","name":"Remote Viewer","tagline":"Remotely access virtual machines","blurb":"Remote Viewer provides a graphical viewer for the guest OS display.","description":"Remote Viewer provides a graphical viewer for the guest OS\ndisplay. At this time it supports guest OS using the VNC\nor SPICE protocols. Further protocols may be supported in\nthe future as user demand dictates. The viewer can connect\ndirectly to both local and remotely hosted guest OS, optionally\nusing SSL/TLS encryption.","developer":"The Virtual Machine Manager contributors","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/virt_manager/virt-viewer/91eed8f062d050601b5015c0f3834438/icons/128x128/org.virt_manager.virt-viewer.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/virt_manager/virt-viewer/91eed8f062d050601b5015c0f3834438/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/virt_manager/virt-viewer/91eed8f062d050601b5015c0f3834438/screenshots/image-1_1248x701@1.png","w":1272,"h":715},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/virt_manager/virt-viewer/91eed8f062d050601b5015c0f3834438/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/virt_manager/virt-viewer/91eed8f062d050601b5015c0f3834438/screenshots/image-2_752x423@1.png","w":1024,"h":576},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/virt_manager/virt-viewer/91eed8f062d050601b5015c0f3834438/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/virt_manager/virt-viewer/91eed8f062d050601b5015c0f3834438/screenshots/image-3_1248x701@1.png","w":1272,"h":715},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/virt_manager/virt-viewer/91eed8f062d050601b5015c0f3834438/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/virt_manager/virt-viewer/91eed8f062d050601b5015c0f3834438/screenshots/image-4_752x423@1.png","w":1200,"h":675}],"categories":["Networking"],"tags":["network","remoteaccess"],"license":"GPL-2.0+","platforms":["linux"],"homepage":"https://virt-manage